.TH "phosh.gsettings" "" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
phosh.gsettings \- GSettings used by phosh
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Phosh uses gsettings for most of its configuration. You can use the \fBgsettings(1)\fP command
to change them or to get details about the option. To get more details about an option use
\fIgsettings describe\fP, e.g.:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
gsettings describe mobi.phosh.shell.cell\-broadcast enabled
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
These are the currently used gsettings schema and keys:
.SS GSettings
.sp
These gsettings are used by \fBphosh\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fImobi.phosh.shell.brightness\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fIauto\-brightness\-offset\fP: Offset added to the calculated auto brightness value
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fImobi.phosh.shell.cell\-broadcast\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fIenabled\fP: Whether receiving cell broadcasts is enabled
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fIsm.puri.phosh\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fIapp\-filter\-mode\fP: Application filtering in overview. This shows all applications:
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
gsettings set sm.puri.phosh app\-filter\-mode \(aq[]\(aq
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fIautomatic\-high\-contrast\-threshold\fP: The brightness threshold to trigger automatic high contrast
.IP \(bu 2
\fIautomatic\-high\-contrast\fP: Whether automatic high contrast is enabled
.IP \(bu 2
\fIenable\-suspend\fP: Whether suspend is enabled in the system menu:
.IP \(bu 2
\fIfavorites\fP: List of favorite applications
.IP \(bu 2
\fIforce\-adaptive\fP: List of app\-id\(aqs phosh considers adaptive (so they are always shown):
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
gsettings set sm.puri.phosh force\-adaptive \(dq[\(aqchromium.desktop\(aq, \(aqfirefox\-esr.desktop\(aq]\(dq
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fIosk\-unfold\-delay\fP: How long to press bottom bar pill for OSK to unfold
.IP \(bu 2
\fIquick\-silent\fP: Silence device by pression Vol\- on incoming calls
.IP \(bu 2
\fIshell\-layout\fP: How to layout shell UI elements around cutouts and notches.
\fIdevice\fP: Automatic based on device settings, \fInone\fP: No automatic layout.
.IP \(bu 2
\fIwwan\-backend\fP: WWan backend to use
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
\fIsm.puri.phosh.emergency\-calls\fP
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fIenabled\fP: Whether emergency calls are enabled. This is
experimental, please check if it works for your povider / in your
country / for your sim card before relying on it.
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.IP \(bu 2
